{"id":"0fa05bc95319d815","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-epsilon-arithmetic.md","title":"df epsilon arithmetic","display":"df epsilon arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-epsilon-arithmetic","aliases":["72-df-epsilon-arithmetic"],"display":"df epsilon arithmetic","depends_on":["[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","[[72-df-epsilon-operator]]","[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local explicit PA epsilon-language extension; supplement Zach2017 syntax/semantics","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_kind":"supplementary-primary-or-local-derivation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-epsilon-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-epsilon-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df epsilon arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e235e3c68d698c2\" href=\"?note=2e235e3c68d698c2\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-operator\">72-df-epsilon-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local explicit PA epsilon-language extension; supplement Zach2017 syntax/semantics"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"supplementary-primary-or-local-derivation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>ε 语法、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 商、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e235e3c68d698c2\" href=\"?note=2e235e3c68d698c2\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-operator\">72-df-epsilon-operator</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P,\\operatorname{Taut}\">\\(\\mathcal P,\\operatorname{Taut}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a> 的命题语法及真值定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon^\\omega\">\\(h\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon\">\\(A,B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon\">\\(s,t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_N\">\\(x\\in V_N\\)</span>。全部对象替换使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_N,\\mathsf{PA}\">\\(B_N,\\mathsf{PA}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_\\varepsilon\">\\(J_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 的源分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\">\\(\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\\)</span>，靶分别为 ε 项与 ε 公式；目标构造子在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 商中形成。源语言的缩写先按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a> 展开。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon\">\\(T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。全称概括只用于由句子公理得到的有限证明行，不用于带未解除自由假设的证明。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 按自由数变量下标递增封闭；联结词缩写在下式固定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA\\land B&amp;:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad A\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\\\\nJ_\\varepsilon(x_i)&amp;:=x_i,\\quad J_\\varepsilon(0):=0,\\quad J_\\varepsilon(f(\\vec t)):=f(\\langle J_\\varepsilon(t_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}),\\\\\nJ_\\varepsilon(tRu)&amp;:=J_\\varepsilon(t)R J_\\varepsilon(u)\\quad(R\\in\\{=,&lt;\\}),\\\\\nJ_\\varepsilon(\\neg A)&amp;:=\\neg J_\\varepsilon(A),\\quad J_\\varepsilon(A\\to B):=J_\\varepsilon(A)\\to J_\\varepsilon(B),\\quad J_\\varepsilon(\\forall xA):=\\forall xJ_\\varepsilon(A),\\\\\n\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(p_i)&amp;:=h(i),\\quad\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(\\neg A):=\\neg\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(A),\\quad\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(A\\to B):=\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(A)\\to\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inst}_\\varepsilon(\\operatorname{Taut})&amp;:=\\{\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(A):A\\in\\operatorname{Taut},\\ h\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon^\\omega\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA\\land B&amp;:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad A\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\\\\nJ_\\varepsilon(x_i)&amp;:=x_i,\\quad J_\\varepsilon(0):=0,\\quad J_\\varepsilon(f(\\vec t)):=f(\\langle J_\\varepsilon(t_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}),\\\\\nJ_\\varepsilon(tRu)&amp;:=J_\\varepsilon(t)R J_\\varepsilon(u)\\quad(R\\in\\{=,&lt;\\}),\\\\\nJ_\\varepsilon(\\neg A)&amp;:=\\neg J_\\varepsilon(A),\\quad J_\\varepsilon(A\\to B):=J_\\varepsilon(A)\\to J_\\varepsilon(B),\\quad J_\\varepsilon(\\forall xA):=\\forall xJ_\\varepsilon(A),\\\\\n\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(p_i)&amp;:=h(i),\\quad\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(\\neg A):=\\neg\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(A),\\quad\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(A\\to B):=\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(A)\\to\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inst}_\\varepsilon(\\operatorname{Taut})&amp;:=\\{\\sigma_h^\\varepsilon(A):A\\in\\operatorname{Taut},\\ h\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon^\\omega\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(A)=\\{x_{i_0},\\ldots,x_{i_{k-1}}\\}\\land i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{ucl}_\\varepsilon(A):=\\forall x_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall x_{i_{k-1}}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(A)=\\{x_{i_0},\\ldots,x_{i_{k-1}}\\}\\land i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{ucl}_\\varepsilon(A):=\\forall x_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall x_{i_{k-1}}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Log}_\\varepsilon:={}&amp;\\operatorname{Inst}_\\varepsilon(\\operatorname{Taut})\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\to A[t/x]:A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):A,B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\exists xA)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\forall x\\neg A:A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{t=t:t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{s=t\\to(A[s/x]\\to A[t/x]):s,t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon,\\ A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Deriv}_\\varepsilon(T,p):\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;p\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall i&lt;|p|\\,\\bigl[p_i\\in T\\cup\\operatorname{Log}_\\varepsilon\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\,(p_k=(p_j\\to p_i))\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\,\\exists x\\in V_N\\,(p_i=\\forall xp_j)\\bigr],\\\\\nT\\vdash_\\varepsilon A:\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists p\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Deriv}_\\varepsilon(T,p)\\land0&lt;|p|\\land p_{|p|-1}=A\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ind}_x^\\varepsilon(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_\\varepsilon\\bigl((A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A\\to A[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall xA\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PA}_\\varepsilon&amp;:=J_\\varepsilon[B_N]\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Ind}_x^\\varepsilon(A):A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_\\varepsilon(C):C\\in\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\varepsilon}(T)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(T\\vdash_\\varepsilon 0=S0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Log}_\\varepsilon:={}&amp;\\operatorname{Inst}_\\varepsilon(\\operatorname{Taut})\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\to A[t/x]:A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):A,B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\exists xA)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\forall x\\neg A:A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{t=t:t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{s=t\\to(A[s/x]\\to A[t/x]):s,t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon,\\ A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Deriv}_\\varepsilon(T,p):\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;p\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall i&lt;|p|\\,\\bigl[p_i\\in T\\cup\\operatorname{Log}_\\varepsilon\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\,(p_k=(p_j\\to p_i))\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\,\\exists x\\in V_N\\,(p_i=\\forall xp_j)\\bigr],\\\\\nT\\vdash_\\varepsilon A:\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists p\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Deriv}_\\varepsilon(T,p)\\land0&lt;|p|\\land p_{|p|-1}=A\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ind}_x^\\varepsilon(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_\\varepsilon\\bigl((A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A\\to A[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall xA\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PA}_\\varepsilon&amp;:=J_\\varepsilon[B_N]\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Ind}_x^\\varepsilon(A):A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_\\varepsilon(C):C\\in\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\varepsilon}(T)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(T\\vdash_\\varepsilon 0=S0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里显式给出 ε 语言上的命题实例、量词与等号公理、有限证明行及新语言归纳。普通算术公式经过 Jε 进入 ε 语法，不把不同语法集合默认为同一集合。存在量词为 ε 语法的原始构造子，故另给出它与 ¬∀¬ 的逻辑联系；未加入 ε 外延公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-epsilon-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2e235e3c68d698c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-two-sorted-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-epsilon-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2e235e3c68d698c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"ε 语法、$\\alpha$ 商、$\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon$、$\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon$、$\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon$ 取 [[72-df-epsilon-operator]]；$\\mathcal P,\\operatorname{Taut}$ 取 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的命题语法及真值定义。$h\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon^\\omega$，$A,B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon$，$s,t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon$，$x\\in V_N$。全部对象替换使用 $\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-two-sorted-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"ε 语法、$\\alpha$ 商、$\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon$、$\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon$、$\\op