ratorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon,\\ A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Deriv}_\\varepsilon(T,p):\\Longleftrightarrow{}&p\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall i<|p|\\,\\bigl[p_i\\in T\\cup\\operatorname{Log}_\\varepsilon\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor\\exists j,k<i\\,(p_k=(p_j\\to p_i))\\lor\\exists j<i\\,\\exists x\\in V_N\\,(p_i=\\forall xp_j)\\bigr],\\\\\nT\\vdash_\\varepsilon A:\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\exists p\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Deriv}_\\varepsilon(T,p)\\land0<|p|\\land p_{|p|-1}=A\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ind}_x^\\varepsilon(A)&:=\\operatorname{ucl}_\\varepsilon\\bigl((A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A\\to A[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall xA\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PA}_\\varepsilon&:=J_\\varepsilon[B_N]\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Ind}_x^\\varepsilon(A):A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_\\varepsilon(C):C\\in\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\varepsilon}(T)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(T\\vdash_\\varepsilon 0=S0).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4680,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-arithmetic|df epsilon arithmetic]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-epsilon-arithmetic|df epsilon arithmetic]]"},{"id":"7b9fccf57e0fe915","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Crit}^0,\\operatorname{Correct}$ 取 [[72-df-epsilon-substitution]]；$\\mathsf{PA}_\\varepsilon,\\vdash_\\varepsilon,J_\\varepsilon,\\operatorname{Con}_\\varepsilon$ 取 [[72-df-epsilon-arithmetic]]。$\\mathsf{PA},\\vdash_2$ 分别取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]、[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]。$\\operatorname{Sent}_1:=\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\\cap\\operatorname{Sent}_2(\\varnothing)$，两语言之间不作隐式同一化。"}],"outgoing":["5ae195683ce3beb4","2e235e3c68d698c2","5e5fb64772853785","b63a805280ad1d8e"]}